---
import CaseLayout from '../../layouts/CaseLayout.astro';
import Img from '../../components/Img.astro';
import Video from '../../components/Video.astro';
---
<CaseLayout
  slug="design-social"
  section="playground"
  eyebrow="Posters, reels + recap videos"
  title="Design + Social"
  summary="Four-plus years of content creation. I currently run social for the WashU Skandalaris Center and WUTV, and I got my start with my high school’s ASB and ReLeaf Candles."
  snapshot={[
    ['Clients', 'Skandalaris Center, WUTV'],
    ['Before that', 'West High ASB, ReLeaf Candles'],
    ['Formats', 'Reels, TikToks, posters, banners'],
    ['Editing since', '2020'],
  ]}
>
  <section id="posters" class="case-section">
    <h2 data-short="Posters">Posters + flyers</h2>
    <p>
      I design flyers that drive sign-ups, Instagram banners that make a club’s focus obvious, and mock ads that
      strengthen a brand’s visual story. Click any poster to see it larger.
    </p>
    <div class="wall wide">
      <figure>
        <Img src="/images/design/kiki-bouba.webp" alt="Poster: Find the Kiki to your Bouba. Apply for the SVC, due Jan 28, with chrome star and blob shapes and a QR code" />
        <figcaption><span class="tag">Skandalaris Center</span> Recruiting for the Skandalaris Venture Competition. The bouba/kiki effect (spiky vs. round shapes) pitches finding a co-founder who complements you.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <Img src="/images/design/tinydesk-black.webp" alt="Poster: WUTV Tiny Desk Concert featuring Irene Han, with a blue retro microphone on black" />
        <figcaption><span class="tag">WUTV</span> Tiny Desk Concert, direction A.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <Img src="/images/design/tinydesk-blue.webp" alt="Poster: WUTV Tiny Desk Concert on textured blue with a retro TV and QR code" />
        <figcaption><span class="tag">WUTV</span> Tiny Desk Concert, direction B. Two directions for one brief.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <Img src="/images/design/perform.webp" alt="Poster: Can you sing? Play an instrument? Maybe both? Well, perform! WUTV Tiny Desk Concerts with a QR code" />
        <figcaption><span class="tag">WUTV</span> Performer call for Tiny Desk Concerts.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure>
        <Img src="/images/design/mod-portrait.webp" alt="Posterized illustration of a 60s mod woman in round sunglasses and a circle-print top, with the photo reference inset" />
        <figcaption><span class="tag">Personal</span> A posterized 60s mod portrait, drawn from a photo reference.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="video" class="case-section">
    <h2 data-short="Reels">Reels + recap videos</h2>
    <p>
      What started as a hobby in 2020, making film edits for fun, became a real passion. Today I make recap videos and
      reels that take behind-the-scenes editing, thoughtful sequencing, and an eye for pacing and emotion.
    </p>
    <div class="reels wide">
      <Video name="skandalaris-welcome" frame="phone" tag="Skandalaris" label="Animated welcome post: Welcome! Your journey starts here" caption="Motion welcome post for new followers." />
      <Video name="skandalaris-ie-awards" frame="phone" tag="Skandalaris" label="TikTok promoting the WashU I&E Awards on April 15" caption="Event promo for the WashU I&E Awards." />
      <Video name="wutv-tiny-desk" frame="phone" tag="WUTV" label="TikTok: Everything will be okay if you sign up for our Tiny Desk Concert" caption="Sign-up push for the Tiny Desk Concert." />
      <Video name="asb-home-game" frame="phone" tag="West High ASB" label="First home game recap reel from the stands" caption="First home game recap." />
      <Video name="asb-staff-breakfast" frame="phone" tag="West High ASB" label="Staff appreciation breakfast recap reel" caption="Staff appreciation breakfast recap." />
    </div>
  </section>
</CaseLayout>

<style>
  .wall { columns: 3 260px; column-gap: 18px; margin: 28px auto; }
  .wall figure { break-inside: avoid; margin: 0 0 22px; }
  .wall :global(img) { width: 100%; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .wall figcaption { font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--ink-2); margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.45; }
  .wall .tag { margin-right: 4px; }
  .reels { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-top: 24px; }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .reels { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .reels { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
</style>
